---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  description="Eldritch builds software for constructing, evaluating, and optimizing AI systems."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="site-container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Eldritch, Inc.</p>

      <h1>
        We build software
        that makes AI
        systems better.
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-lede">
        Eldritch builds infrastructure for constructing,
        evaluating, and optimizing AI systems.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/azathoth">
          Explore Azathoth
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <a
          class="button button-secondary"
          href="https://github.com/EldritchInc/azathoth"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          View on GitHub
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="product">
    <div class="site-container product-grid">
      <div class="section-label">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our first product</p>
        <p class="product-name">Azathoth</p>
      </div>

      <div class="product-content">
        <h2>
          AI workflows should be able to learn
          how to become better AI workflows.
        </h2>

        <p class="section-lede">
          Azathoth is an open-source framework for constructing,
          evaluating, and optimizing multi-model AI systems across
          quality, reliability, latency, and cost.
        </p>

        <div class="capabilities" aria-label="Azathoth capabilities">
          <div class="capability">
            <span class="capability-number">01</span>
            <h3>Construct</h3>
            <p>
              Compose models, prompts, tools, context, and multi-step
              workflows as explicit software systems.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="capability">
            <span class="capability-number">02</span>
            <h3>Evaluate</h3>
            <p>
              Measure behavior against explicit goals using repeatable
              experiments and evidence.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="capability">
            <span class="capability-number">03</span>
            <h3>Optimize</h3>
            <p>
              Search for better tradeoffs between capability, quality,
              reliability, latency, and cost.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-actions">
          <a class="text-link" href="/azathoth">
            Explore Azathoth
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>

          <a
            class="text-link"
            href="https://github.com/EldritchInc/azathoth"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            Source on GitHub
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="thesis">
    <div class="site-container thesis-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">What we believe</p>

      <h2>
        AI systems should be
        engineered, not guessed at.
      </h2>

      <div class="thesis-copy">
        <p>
          Modern AI applications combine models, prompts, tools,
          retrieval, memory, context, and multi-step workflows.
        </p>

        <p>
          The number of possible configurations quickly exceeds what
          an engineer can reasonably explore by hand.
        </p>

        <p class="thesis-emphasis">
          We build systems that measure what works—and use that
          evidence to improve what comes next.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach">
    <div class="site-container approach-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p>

        <h2>
          Treat AI behavior
          as an engineering problem.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="principles">
        <article>
          <p class="principle-number">01</p>
          <div>
            <h3>Make the system explicit.</h3>
            <p>
              Models and prompts are components of larger systems.
              Their relationships should be represented, inspectable,
              and testable.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <p class="principle-number">02</p>
          <div>
            <h3>Measure before optimizing.</h3>
            <p>
              Improvement requires evidence. Evaluation should be
              built into the architecture rather than added after
              deployment.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <p class="principle-number">03</p>
          <div>
            <h3>Optimize the whole system.</h3>
            <p>
              The best model is not always the best system. Quality,
              reliability, latency, cost, and capability belong in
              the same engineering conversation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing">
    <div class="site-container closing-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Eldritch, Inc.</p>

        <h2>
          Building infrastructure
          for better AI systems.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="closing-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/azathoth">
          Explore Azathoth
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <a
          class="button button-secondary"
          href="mailto:eris@eldritchinc.com"
        >
          Contact Eldritch
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 5rem);
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .eyebrow-light {
    color: #9dbbac;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 0.93;
  }

  .hero-lede,
  .section-lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .hero-lede {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
  }

  .hero-actions,
  .section-actions,
  .closing-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    min-height: 3.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color 150ms ease,
      color 150ms ease,
      border-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .button-primary:hover,
  .button-primary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .button-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .button-secondary:hover,
  .button-secondary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .product,
  .approach,
  .closing {
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 11rem);
  }

  .product {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .product-grid,
  .approach-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem);
  }

  .section-label .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .product-name {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .product-content h2,
  .approach h2,
  .closing h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .product-content h2 {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .section-lede {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
  }

  .capabilities {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .capability {
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .capability:first-child {
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .capability + .capability {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .capability-number,
  .principle-number {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .capability h3 {
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .capability p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .section-actions {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .text-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .text-link:hover,
  .text-link:focus-visible {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .thesis {
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .thesis-inner {
    padding-block: clamp(7rem, 14vw, 13rem);
  }

  .thesis h2 {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 0.95;
  }

  .thesis-copy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    margin-top: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
  }

  .thesis-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #b8bdb9;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .thesis-copy .thesis-emphasis {
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .approach {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .approach h2 {
    max-width: 550px;
  }

  .principles {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .principles article {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding-block: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .principle-number {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }

  .principles h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .principles article div p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .closing {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .closing-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .closing h2 {
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .closing-actions {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .product-grid,
    .approach-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .capabilities {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .capability {
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .capability + .capability {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .thesis-copy {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .closing-inner {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 16vw, 5rem);
    }

    .hero-actions,
    .closing-actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .button {
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .principles article {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>